<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2022-11 on</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2022-11/</link><description>Recent content in 2022-11 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 05 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2022-11/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>시험기간과 갑자기추워진 일기</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog23/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog23/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="시험기간과-갑자기추워진-일기"&gt;&#10; 시험기간과 갑자기추워진 일기&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%8b%9c%ed%97%98%ea%b8%b0%ea%b0%84%ea%b3%bc-%ea%b0%91%ec%9e%90%ea%b8%b0%ec%b6%94%ec%9b%8c%ec%a7%84-%ec%9d%bc%ea%b8%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 11. 5. 23:34&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d14db63-296f-4937-9225-6293bebe2787" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;제이디에서 시험공부 본격으로는 처음시작한날&#10;되게막막했다 ㅜ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b46c1a0a-0a82-43fb-8198-0ca4293abeb4" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;노브랜드에서 만든 걸작 모음 ㅎㅎ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="828" height="1792" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d2b2268-f227-412f-b745-bc50c4c8ef05" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;오빠가이렇게 사랑해주는데 내가어떻게 안행복하나&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;옛날생각났어나도&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46e9e3ae-8e2a-4599-b1ed-3656fcfb2f80" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;어느 시험기간&#10;시험이 임박하지 않은 시험기간이 가장 행복해..&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="2275" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38f45993-b34d-4b5f-b70b-3a1c01a61a21" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;새로생긴 건물 괜찮은것같으면서도 정이 안간다 집중도잘안되구&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee999a12-aa94-4def-afcb-b9c6d8ee7971" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;멋진 하늘&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="591" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60900bf5-fae6-44b3-9e3b-2daf5829c16c" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;GTA 되게많이보던때네 ㅋㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3f173eb-b14c-4a0e-99f2-df374a66e427" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;흡연구역.. 아니 금연구역의 멋진 풍경&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="591" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f44ab708-acf2-42a9-b1ee-4ca8322d7b1b" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="591" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca555169-3305-4d4f-a66c-2318020b97cd" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;뷰좋다잉&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b813e13-7b32-4600-9e54-b9e05c630e7f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;커피명가에서 분노의 빅데이터 공부&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;크롤링 코드 줄줄 써야될줄 알았는데 그런거 아니어서 다행이었다 ㅜ&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>